    <string name="edit_placeholder">Not implemented in this build</string>
    <string name="edit_help">The composer is deliberately left as an entry point only.

Planned: a timeline editor where you add frames, tweak per-slot colours, adjust timings, duplicate ranges, and export CSV that the PC player and this app can both play.

It is roughly the size of the whole rest of the app, so it is scheduled after the live and sequence screens are solid.</string>
